     "n": 1,
     "text": "the feverish pride of a controversialist is inexhaustible; those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "who are filled with wealth serve you; even me serve those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "that have a longing to listen to me that the taint of their",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "hearts may be removed; if you have no respect for me, the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "less have I for you; O king, here am I off.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
