     "n": 1,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "55. Fruits for a meal, sweet water for drink, the (bare)",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "surface of the earth for a bed, and barks for raimnent, are",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "all good (preferable) enough; but I cannot tolerate ( lit.",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "sanction ) the impudence of wicked men, all whose senses",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "have been maddened by the fresh ( acquisition of ) wealth as",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "if by drinking wine.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
